{"ref":"BDB, אֵהוּד","hw":"אֵהוּד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵהוּד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a Benjamite, son of Gera, deliverer of Isr. from Moab <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:15\" href=\"/Judges.3.15\">Ju 3:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:16\" href=\"/Judges.3.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:20\" href=\"/Judges.3.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:21\" href=\"/Judges.3.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:23\" href=\"/Judges.3.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:26\" href=\"/Judges.3.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:1\" href=\"/Judges.4.1\">4:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Benjamite, son of Bilhan (= foregoing?) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.10\">1 Ch 7:10</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲהָהּ","prev":"BDB, אֹ֫הַד"}